#: ../../src/install/binary.rst:4
msgid "Installing binary packages"
msgstr "二进制包安装"

#: ../../src/install/binary.rst:6
msgid "At the moment, binary installers are built only for Microsoft Windows. Download and run the installer that matches your system by using the table below:"
msgstr "目前，二进制包安装器仅对微软 Windows 系统构建。请从下表中选取与您的系统相符的安装器来下载和运行："

